 "change": "DEV3 Row DELETE first path, stage 2b-3 (dev3-row-delete.md#implementation-2b3): the test-only scope3 per-native observers semantic_row/{status,undo,leaf}.rs learn DeleteForward/DeleteClr/DeletePrune, the N1 cross-check runs every observer, leaf.rs included, over every history D group, and the cases 2b-1/2b-2 left are added (another RowId refused by C, leaf.rs and A; A's INSERT Forward at the leaf reservation boundary 16188/16189; RDL-B06; RDL-R07). No product path changes; native fault cuts are stage 3.",
